{'symbol': 'CBOE', 'date': '2023-05-22 09:30:00', 'title': 'FIRST TRUST EXPANDS ITS TARGET OUTCOME ETFS® LINEUP TO PROVIDE SMALL CAP EXPOSURE WITH FT CBOE VEST U.S. SMALL CAP MODERATE BUFFER ETF - MAY', 'text': "WHEATON, ILL.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FIRST TRUST ADVISORS L.P. (“FIRST TRUST”) A LEADING EXCHANGE-TRADED FUND (“ETF”) PROVIDER AND ASSET MANAGER, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT LAUNCHED THE FT CBOE VEST U.S. SMALL CAP MODERATE BUFFER ETF– MAY (CBOE: SMAY) (THE “FUND”). THE FUND IS THE LATEST ADDITION TO FIRST TRUST'S SUITE OF TARGET OUTCOME ETFS®, WHICH HAS $9.5 BILLION IN TOTAL NET ASSETS AS OF 4/28/23 AND IS AMONG THE FASTEST GROWING IN THE OUTCOME ORIENTED ETFS SPACE. “HISTORY HAS SHOWN THAT REMAINING D."}